y the Investigation Branch of Customs and Excise such as the illegal import of goods, illegal immigration and business transactions amongst travellers.\n\nThe Revenue Men was produced by Gerard Glaister. The series lasted for three series and 39 episodes in total. In spite of this fact, all of the episodes were later wiped, with no episodes extant in the BBC archives as of 2009.","poster_path":null,"media_type":"tv","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[],"popularity":1.8915,"first_air_date":"1967-03-28","softcore":false,"vote_average":5.5,"vote_count":2,"origin_country":["GB"]}]},{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":3881804,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"John Logan Jr.","original_name":"John Logan Jr.","popularity":0.0143,"profile_path":null,"known_for":[{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/ewacCZjc710KBjxztABTwoWMken.jpg","id":9964,"title":"Bad Taste","original_title":"Bad Taste","overview":"A team from the intergalactic fast food chain Crumb's Crunchy Delights descends on Earth, planning to make human flesh the newest taste sensation. After they wipe out the New Zealand town Kaihoro, the country’s Astro-Investigation and Defense Service (AIaDS) is called in to deal with the problem. Things are complicated due to Giles, an aid worker who comes to Kaihoro the same day to collect change from the residents. He is captured by the aliens, and AIaDS stages a rescue mission that quickly becomes an all-out assault on the aliens’ headquarters.","poster_path":"/msttMX3undIiaeJLZbMRq94v1bw.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[28,35,27,878],"popularity":3.2246,"release_date":"1987-12-11","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.292,"vote_count":938}]},{"adult":false,"gender":0,"id":1588939,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"John Logan Brent","original_name":"John Logan Brent","popularity":0.1539,"profile_path":null,"known_for":[{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":null,"id":381026,"title":"Look & See: A Portrait of Wendell Berry","original_titl