396622,"title":"Andover","original_title":"Andover","overview":"Genetics professor Adam Slope clones his wife Dawn after she dies in a fire but the woman he creates is different than the woman he loved, so he tries over and over, in a desperate attempt to get her back exactly as she was.","poster_path":"/1FVXqYkHTMyCsqrBWJ7qUNKcwUT.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[878,35,10749],"popularity":1.2941,"release_date":"2018-03-30","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.156,"vote_count":48},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/4oc2H3LOLuNIBflpN4VZf2LFA0O.jpg","id":462517,"title":"A Woman Deceived","original_title":"A Woman Deceived","overview":"It’s been one year since Elizabeth’s husband, Bill, died in a tragic horseback riding accident and she is starting to move on. When she runs into Travis Brown, the cowboy she met the same weekend Bill died, the two immediately hit it off. Travis is just what Elizabeth needed to come into her life and they soon get married. When new evidence surfaces implying that Bill’s death wasn’t an accident, Elizabeth must find a way to protect herself and her son from the man she married.","poster_path":"/uKjLTFN0Zix4fgoFmpa0NoIRPqF.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[18,53,10770],"popularity":1.316,"release_date":"2017-05-18","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.4,"vote_count":11}]},{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":159769,"known_for_department":"Writing","name":"John Hunter","original_name":"John Hunter","popularity":0.2631,"profile_path":null,"known_for":[{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/5m3iuO5ACGuOE15Gv1TXmNweXRK.jpg","id":42136,"title":"The Grey Fox","original_title":"The Grey Fox","overview":"Old West highwayman Bill Miner, known to Pinkertons as \"The Gentleman Bandit,\" is released in 1901 after 33 years in prison. A genial and charming old man, he re-enters a world unfamiliar to him, and returns to the only thing that gives him purpose — robbery.","poster_path":"/ycE2WBSczxBgM1vtRQ9KTtwGTMR.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[37,36],"popularity":1.1456,"release_date":"1982-12-16","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.9,"vote_count":38},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/qm1IG9OFhbPj6PCAxiB2F0iAQ54.jpg","id":43198,"title":"Carrington V.C.","original_title":"Carrington V.C.","overview":"Major Charles Carrington (David Niven) is arrested for taking £125 from the base safe. He also faces two other charges that could finish his distinguished service career. He decides to act in his own defence at his court martial hearing, his argument being that he is owed a lot of money from the army for his various postings that have cost him out of his own pocket. To further complicate the proceedings, Carrington alleges he told his superior, the very disliked Colonel Henniker, that he was taking the money from the safe. A man's career, his marriage, and quite a few reputations all hang in the balance.","poster_path":"/awXt1JTzcwmgtxRfkxZz2C36V4s.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[18],"popularity":1.0075,"release_date":"1954-12-09","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":6.095,"vote_count":21},{"adult":false,"backdrop_path":"/mvVzgRPSvA6QuncRSmPk3Fnm2lI.jpg","id":54583,"title":"Hollywood North","original_title":"Hollywood North","overview":"The making of a serious, Canadian arthouse film descends into Hollywood farce when its producer is forced to compromise his vision to accommodate his drug-addled star, his leading lady and his venal backers.","poster_path":"/qFreUbQn823R2KHZhVJituFcP7c.jpg","media_type":"movie","original_language":"en","genre_ids":[35],"popularity":0.94,"release_date":"2004-01-12","softcore":false,"video":false,"vote_average":5.056,"vote_count":18}]},{"adult":false,"gender":2,"id":1425157,"known_for_department":"Acting","name":"Brian Button","original_name":"Brian Button","popularity":0.4993,"profile_path":"/9Gc2XaHeMvlDdjSVlTiM68QqNAf.jpg","known_for":